    "detailed_description": "<strong>Looking for Imago</strong> is a peaceful but yet challenging puzzle-platformer in which you will be led to tame insects &amp; natural elements to progress in your own quest. It may also be the time to discover an atypical way to interact with the beings of this world.<br><br>In this game, you will endorse the responsibility of being a sprout carrier, one of those little beings who secretly takes care of delivering majestic tree sprouts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594150/extras/28ffc832a65db4711410e511758cf3bf.avif?t=1744190680\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2b50 FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tame your environment to overcome its obstacles<br></li><li> Interact with insects and natural elements in an original way<br></li><li> Control your character with a simple &amp; fine tuned control scheme<br></li><li> Build your own levels and challenge your friends</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594150/extras/65604c43219c39a9872bff51b81e205f.avif?t=1744190680\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf31 WHAT'S INSIDE?</h2>The full game is currently composed of more than 70 levels in 3 environments.<br>A lost insect can be saved in every levels. Hidden seeds can also be found to build a collection.",
